    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memography</strong> is a wacky 2D quiz game about memes, where players guess popular internet memes, compete for points, and unlock funny mini-modes. The game features over 100 unique memes, three difficulty levels, star bonuses, and hidden easter eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each correct answer earns points, and a fast-reacting brain gets rewarded. Complete the game to unlock speedrun mode and test your skills against the clock! <i>Memography</i> is a fun and lighthearted adventure through the history of internet culture.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memography</strong> is a wacky 2D quiz game about memes, where players guess popular internet memes, compete for points, and unlock funny mini-modes. The game features over 100 unique memes, three difficulty levels, star bonuses, and hidden easter eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each correct answer earns points, and a fast-reacting brain gets rewarded. Complete the game to unlock speedrun mode and test your skills against the clock! <i>Memography</i> is a fun and lighthearted adventure through the history of internet culture.</p>",
